## 1. The "Why" (User Story)

**As a** [specific user type],
**I want to** [specific action],
**So that** [valuable outcome].

---

## 2. The Value (ICE Score)

| Metric | Score (1-10) | Rationale (1 sentence) |
|:-------|:------------:|:-----------------------|
| **Impact** | **[X]** | [How much does this move success metrics?] |
| **Confidence** | **[X]** | [How sure are we about impact/effort?] |
| **Ease** | **[X]** | [How fast can we build this?] |
| **TOTAL** | **[XXX]** | *(Impact × Confidence × Ease)* |

> **Threshold:** Score < 200 → Backlog | 200-500 → Discuss | > 500 → Build

---

## 3. Acceptance Criteria (Definition of Done)

*Observable behaviors only. No implementation details.*

- [ ] User can [Action A] and see [Result A] within [Time]
- [ ] System handles [Edge Case B] by showing [Error Message]
- [ ] [Data C] is saved and persists after refresh
- [ ] [Performance requirement, e.g., response < 500ms]

---

## 4. Constraints & Out of Scope

**Constraints** (must follow):
- Must use existing [Tech Stack/Library]
- Max latency: [X]ms
- Budget: <$[X]/month for external APIs

**Out of Scope** (explicitly cut):
- [Feature X] — will consider in future iteration
- [Feature Y] — separate spec needed

